  "prefLabel": "He-P 3304.01 Local Agency Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3304.01 Local Agency Requirements. A local health or human service agency shall:\n\n(a) Identify FMNP recipients and provide them with FMNP benefits, nutrition education, and related benefits under state-approved agreements between the local WIC agency and the department in accordance with 7 CFR 248.9; and\n\n(b) Adhere to monitoring of FMNP policies and procedures once every 2 years in accordance with 7 CFR 248.10(e)(4).\n\nSource. #14200, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p3300.html"
}
